+# Earth Eye
+
+This checkout runs as **Earth Eye** ([eartheye.us](https://eartheye.us)). The application code is the MIT-licensed project by Bilawal Sidhu ([gods-eye-view](https://github.com/bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view)). The npm package name stays `gods-eye-view` because the source imports itself that way. The on-screen name, logo, and tagline are original. License, third-party notices, and data-source terms in this repository still apply. Bundled datasets are not covered by MIT.
+
+The upstream project document follows.
+
+---
+
 <div align="center">
 
 # 🌐 God's Eye View
